     "language_code": "eng",
     "text": [
      "Śivānanda says, “It is by his anurāga (that is, Śrī Rādhā’s deep attachment) that Śyāma-tanu (dark-complexioned Kṛṣṇa) has now become the golden Śrī Gaurāṅga, and is begging for that prema.”"
     ]
    }
